```spl
* ============================================================================
* B01 - Setpoint outside approved range  (Oldsmar-class)
* Read-only. Alert on CHANGE to an out-of-band setpoint value.
* Data model: docs/data-model.md   SP limits carried as ll/hl on *.SP rows.
* ============================================================================

index=ot_historian sourcetype=historian:snapshot quality=Good
    tag IN ("PLANT1.*.SP")
| lookup ot_baseline.csv tag OUTPUT ll as sp_min hl as sp_max

* Detect the write: value differs from the previous sample for this tag
| sort 0 tag _time
| streamstats current=f last(value) as prev_value by tag
| eval changed = if(isnull(prev_value) OR value!=prev_value, 1, 0)

* Out-of-approved-band
| eval out_of_band = if(value < sp_min OR value > sp_max, 1, 0)
| where changed==1 AND out_of_band==1

| eval breach = if(value < sp_min, "below_min", "above_max")
| eval detection="B01", severity="high"
| table _time tag prev_value value sp_min sp_max breach severity detection
| sort - _time
```
